1
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:35,240
Ah, Woojae, right there, just a little more...

2
00:00:55,850 --> 00:01:00,100
Come deeper, you're driving me crazy.

3
00:01:09,240 --> 00:01:13,820
Go Taewoon, Kim Dohyun

4
00:01:25,710 --> 00:01:30,340
Baek Seunghoon, Lee Kyungwon

5
00:01:41,350 --> 00:01:49,280
Twisted Tie

6
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:52,570
Episode 4. Twisted Triangle

7
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:03,060
Are you alright?
Are you uncomfortable anywhere?

8
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:08,100
Are you alright?
Are you uncomfortable anywhere?

9
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:13,900
Stop. I've lost interest.

10
00:03:17,410 --> 00:03:19,910
Did I do something wrong?

11
00:03:22,950 --> 00:03:24,790
No...

12
00:03:26,250 --> 00:03:28,540
You're always perfect.

13
00:03:29,790 --> 00:03:32,300
That's why it's boring, today.

14
00:03:42,100 --> 00:03:44,520
Go clean up and leave.

15
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:46,560
I want to be alone today.

16
00:04:09,790 --> 00:04:13,800
It's about time he answered his phone.

17
00:04:39,200 --> 00:04:43,990
[Matchbox, Mr. Baek]

18
00:05:04,890 --> 00:05:09,140
- Team Leader Kang.
- Yes, Mr. Baek.

19
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:13,190
Were you sleeping? You sound quite drowsy.

20
00:05:13,190 --> 00:05:17,440
So, have you given some thought to the offer I made earlier today?

21
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:25,580
I believe I told you.
I have no intention of sending my employee to such a private setting.

22
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:30,580
- We can discuss the contract again tomorrow morning...
- Come on, Team Leader Kang.

23
00:05:30,580 --> 00:05:33,960
Let's not drag this out.

24
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:41,470
If you want to see my stamp on that contract,
send Lee Sunwoo to my hotel room tomorrow.

25
00:05:44,970 --> 00:05:50,930
If you just send him,
I might send him back without laying a finger on him,

26
00:05:50,930 --> 00:05:53,440
or maybe not.

27
00:05:59,570 --> 00:06:02,490
Make your decision and let me know by tomorrow.

28
00:06:26,430 --> 00:06:30,600
Mr. Kang, are you alright?

29
00:06:30,600 --> 00:06:34,730
Did something happen at work?

30
00:06:34,730 --> 00:06:38,650
I thought I heard my name earlier.

31
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:56,710
Mr. Kang.

32
00:07:02,880 --> 00:07:05,510
[Matchbox, Mr. Baek]
Veri Hotel Suite 1502, Tomorrow 9 PM

33
00:07:13,430 --> 00:07:17,270
Veri Hotel Suite 1502, Tomorrow 9 PM

34
00:07:17,560 --> 00:07:21,480
Tomorrow night, go to that hotel.

35
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:25,700
The final condition for this contract... is you.

36
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:27,280
What?

37
00:07:27,280 --> 00:07:30,620
Go and humor him just until he signs it.

38
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:37,750
Put personal feelings aside.
This is a work order from your team leader.

39
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:44,920
Mr. Kang, you're joking right now, right?

40
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:49,720
You saw the way that Mr. Baek was looking at me,
Mr. Kang.

41
00:07:51,640 --> 00:07:56,180
And yet, you want me to walk in there on my own two feet?

42
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:02,270
Are you testing me or something?

43
00:08:02,270 --> 00:08:05,690
I'm not joking.

44
00:08:05,690 --> 00:08:08,570
Separate your personal and professional life.

45
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:24,380
Separate... personal and professional.

46
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:33,470
Right. I'm a company employee too,
and a newbie who jumps when Mr. Kang says jump.

47
00:08:42,150 --> 00:08:44,690
However, Mr. Kang.

48
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:49,900
How far exactly
does this 'work order' extend?

49
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,910
You told me to humor him.

50
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:56,990
- Mr. Lee.
- Do I just need to pour him drinks?

51
00:08:56,990 --> 00:09:02,040
Or do we wash up together,
and I lie in his bed,

52
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:08,800
and beg him to touch me and adore me with my own mouth
before he gives us his damn stamp?

53
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:15,850
- Mr. Lee, don't cross the line.
- You were the one... who crossed the line first, Mr. Kang.

54
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:31,860
You were the one who grabbed my tie and shook me
with that defenseless look, Mr. Kang.

55
00:09:33,110 --> 00:09:38,080
And after making me go crazy for you like this,

56
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:43,540
now you're telling me to go wag my tail for another man?

57
00:09:46,130 --> 00:09:48,420
How...

58
00:09:49,170 --> 00:09:51,720
How could you do this to me?

59
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:55,340
To me, you're my whole world, Mr. Kang...

60
00:09:56,390 --> 00:10:05,310
To you, Mr. Kang, was I just some toy you could throw
into someone else's bed whenever you wanted?

61
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:29,090
I'll go tomorrow. I'll walk into that hotel
you ordered me to go to.

62
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:34,340
This is truly miserable.

63
00:10:43,770 --> 00:10:46,560
I'll be on my way.

64
00:10:46,560 --> 00:10:54,780
Tomorrow night, I'll spread my legs like you ordered
and make sure to get that stamp...

65
00:10:54,780 --> 00:10:58,070
But you must promise me this one thing in return.

66
00:10:59,870 --> 00:11:11,340
Promise me that while I'm gasping in his arms,
you'll be right here, feeling just as horrified and miserable as I am, Mr. Kang.

67
00:12:42,640 --> 00:12:47,020
[Mr. Lee]
I'm heading out now.

68
00:12:50,810 --> 00:12:54,110
[Mr. Lee]
I'm heading out now.

69
00:13:54,630 --> 00:13:58,090
What brings you here, Mr. Kang?

70
00:13:59,550 --> 00:14:03,880
You were the one who pushed me to go, Mr. Kang.

71
00:14:13,020 --> 00:14:17,690
What else, the contract...

72
00:14:19,440 --> 00:14:23,950
Right, I came to confirm that the important contract
is proceeding properly.

73
00:14:25,450 --> 00:14:30,540
I was worried you'd act like an idiot again
and get on Mr. Baek's bad side.

74
00:14:30,540 --> 00:14:34,460
I came to supervise you as your team leader.

75
00:14:45,180 --> 00:14:47,260
But...

76
00:14:52,390 --> 00:14:56,520
What is with your clothes when your superior is here?

77
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:04,030
Did I teach you to stay so sloppily unbuttoned like this?

78
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:25,340
Did that bastard...
already touch you?

79
00:15:25,340 --> 00:15:28,840
Where? Answer me.

80
00:15:30,010 --> 00:15:34,270
Where, where did he touch you? Your lips?

81
00:15:36,020 --> 00:15:40,400
Your waist? Or further?

82
00:15:42,570 --> 00:15:48,450
Why are you acting like this?
Didn't you send me here fully prepared for this?

83
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:55,000
Prepared?
Ha...

84
00:15:56,290 --> 00:15:58,670
Prepared...

85
00:16:06,050 --> 00:16:09,800
Yeah, I told you to go.

86
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:19,730
Spouting nonsense about separating personal and professional life, acting all cool...
I... I threw you in here with my own hands.

87
00:16:23,400 --> 00:16:25,690
But fuck...

88
00:16:32,910 --> 00:16:35,200
I was out of my mind.

89
00:16:37,710 --> 00:16:40,370
I was completely insane.

90
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:44,420
It hasn't even been a minute, but... I can't breathe.

91
00:16:45,300 --> 00:16:48,300
I feel like I'm going crazy.

92
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:53,600
How could I be prepared for this!

93
00:17:00,020 --> 00:17:03,400
I hate that bastard even looking at you...

94
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:12,410
And it's even more horrifying that you'd smile at him
with that sweet face of yours.

95
00:17:12,410 --> 00:17:16,290
I really feel like I'm going to die.

96
00:17:28,550 --> 00:17:31,220
Don't...

97
00:17:32,800 --> 00:17:35,300
Please don't, Sunwoo.

98
00:17:35,300 --> 00:17:37,850
It's all my fault.

99
00:17:37,850 --> 00:17:46,320
I'm a son of a bitch and a stupid piece of trash.
I don't care about being a team leader or the contract...

100
00:17:48,650 --> 00:17:51,360
Please...

101
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:58,660
Don't show that sweet face of yours
to any bastard other than me.

102
00:18:05,630 --> 00:18:08,840
Don't abandon me, please.

103
00:18:20,430 --> 00:18:22,680
What is this, Team Leader Kang?

104
00:18:26,230 --> 00:18:29,360
Are you a voyeur or something?

105
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:34,240
Coming into someone else's hotel room without permission,
are you here to watch?

106
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:41,160
Mr. Baek, this is...

107
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:46,830
Mr. Lee, it seems your master got worried
and chased you all the way here.

108
00:18:46,830 --> 00:18:50,710
What will you do? Do you want to go back?

109
00:18:51,840 --> 00:18:53,970
No.

110
00:18:53,970 --> 00:18:58,100
Mr. Kang told me to separate my personal and professional life.

111
00:18:58,680 --> 00:19:03,430
I'm here to follow his work orders.

112
00:19:06,900 --> 00:19:09,400
Did you hear that? Team Leader Kang.

113
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:14,990
So either watch, or get out.

114
00:19:14,990 --> 00:19:17,240
Suit yourself.

115
00:19:36,630 --> 00:19:38,640
Don't.

116
00:19:40,260 --> 00:19:42,390
Don't...

117
00:19:43,770 --> 00:19:47,350
Don't touch what's mine, fu...

118
00:19:54,110 --> 00:19:57,030
You couldn't hold back after all.

119
00:19:58,570 --> 00:20:01,120
Right, Team Leader Kang.

120
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:05,330
Even you can't bear to let someone else steal something this delicious, right?

121
00:20:21,090 --> 00:20:27,890
If you feel wronged, why don't you tie him up yourself?
It's too much of a waste for only you to know Mr. Lee's body, isn't it?

122
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:52,440
Twisted Tie
